<!-- ============================================================
  Meeye fork – appfilter additions (paste before </resources> in BOTH
  assets/appfilter.xml and res/xml/appfilter.xml).
  VERIFIED   = package AND launcher activity confirmed from the app's repo/manifest or an icon-request DB.
  UNVERIFIED = package confirmed (Play/Mi/app-store listing) but launcher activity is a best guess.
               Check on-device with:
               adb shell cmd package resolve-activity --brief -c android.intent.category.LAUNCHER <package>
  ============================================================ -->

